<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Example Snapshot — AI Growth Catalyst</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
<meta name="description" content="An example of the free AI opportunity snapshot delivered after every discovery call." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root {
    --cream: #fafaf7;
    --cream-2: #f1f1ec;
    --cream-3: #e6e6df;
    --ink: #0f172a;
    --ink-soft: #1e293b;
    --ink-dim: #475569;
    --ink-faint: #94a3b8;
    --terracotta: #c85a3e;
    --terracotta-deep: #a3432b;
    --terracotta-soft: #fde7df;
    --sage: #4f7d3f;
    --sage-soft: #d6e3cc;
    --gold: #b8843a;
    --gold-soft: #f5e9d6;
    --line: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.10);
    --line-soft: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 20% 10%, rgba(200, 90, 62, 0.06), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 90% 30%, rgba(107, 130, 104, 0.06), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--terracotta); transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* PAGE WRAPPER */
  .page {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 2rem 6rem;
  }

  /* SAMPLE BANNER */
  .sample-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    background: var(--gold-soft);
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 132, 58, 0.25);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .sample-banner strong { color: var(--gold); }

  /* DOCUMENT CARD */
  .doc-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);
  }

  /* DOC HEADER */
  .doc-header {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
  }
  .doc-header-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .doc-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .doc-date {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .doc-type-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(200, 90, 62, 0.25);
    color: #f4a68a;
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .doc-business-name {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .doc-business-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    opacity: 0.65;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* DOC BODY */
  .doc-body {
    padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
  }

  /* OPPORTUNITY BLOCK */
  .opportunity-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .opportunity-title {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* METRICS ROW */
  .metrics-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .metric {
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--cream-3);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
  }
  .metric-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .metric-value {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .metric-value.green { color: var(--sage); }
  .metric-value.gold { color: var(--gold); }

  /* BODY TEXT */
  .doc-section { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .doc-section-title {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .doc-section p {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .doc-section p + p { margin-top: 0.75rem; }

  /* WHAT WE HEARD */
  .heard-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .heard-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .heard-list li::before {
    content: '"';
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  /* NEXT STEP BOX */
  .next-step-box {
    background: var(--terracotta-soft);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200, 90, 62, 0.2);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .next-step-box h4 {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--terracotta-deep);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .next-step-box p {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* DISCLAIMER */
  .doc-disclaimer {
    background: var(--cream-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 1.5rem 3rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* CTA BELOW DOC */
  .below-cta {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .below-cta p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .below-cta p strong { color: var(--ink); }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page { padding: 2rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
    .doc-header { padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem; }
    .doc-body { padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem; }
    .doc-disclaimer { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; }
    .metrics-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .doc-business-name { font-size: 1.35rem; }
    nav { padding: 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="/" class="logo">
    <span style="width:28px;height:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28">
        <rect width="28" height="28" rx="8" fill="#0f172a"/>
        <path d="M8 20 L14 8 L20 20" stroke="#fafaf7" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M10 16 H18" stroke="#c85a3e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    AI Growth Catalyst
  </a>
  <a href="/call/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a free call →</a>
</nav>

<main class="page">

  <div class="sample-banner">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
    <span><strong>Example only.</strong> Business details are fictional. This is what you receive free after every discovery call.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="doc-card">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="doc-header">
      <div class="doc-header-meta">
        <div class="doc-brand">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20">
            <rect width="28" height="28" rx="8" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.15)"/>
            <path d="M8 20 L14 8 L20 20" stroke="#fafaf7" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M10 16 H18" stroke="#c85a3e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          AI Growth Catalyst
        </div>
        <span class="doc-date">October 2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-type-pill">AI Opportunity Snapshot</div>
      <p class="doc-business-name">Greenleaf Landscaping</p>
      <p class="doc-business-desc">Residential and commercial landscaping · 6 staff · Bristol</p>
    </div>

    <!-- BODY -->
    <div class="doc-body">

      <div class="doc-section">
        <p class="opportunity-label">Top opportunity identified</p>
        <h2 class="opportunity-title">Automated quote follow-up and job scheduling assistant</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="metrics-row">
        <div class="metric">
          <p class="metric-label">Est. time saved</p>
          <p class="metric-value green">4–6 hrs/wk</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric">
          <p class="metric-label">Implementation cost</p>
          <p class="metric-value gold">£800–£1,200</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric">
          <p class="metric-label">Complexity</p>
          <p class="metric-value">Low–Medium</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="doc-section">
        <p class="doc-section-title">What we heard</p>
        <ul class="heard-list">
          <li>We send quotes out manually and then forget to follow up — we lose jobs just because we don't chase</li>
          <li>Scheduling takes ages because we're going back and forth on WhatsApp with customers to find times</li>
          <li>I'm spending Sunday evenings doing admin I should be able to hand off</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="doc-section">
        <p class="doc-section-title">The opportunity</p>
        <p>Greenleaf sends roughly 15–20 quotes per week, most via email or WhatsApp. Currently there is no systematic follow-up — if a customer doesn't respond, the quote goes cold. Based on the call, a conservative estimate is that 2–3 jobs per month are lost this way.</p>
        <p>An automated follow-up sequence — triggered when a quote is sent, chasing at 48 hours and again at 5 days if no response — would recover a meaningful portion of that lost revenue with no manual effort. Combined with a simple scheduling link (Calendly or equivalent, connected to your calendar), customers could book site visits without any back-and-forth.</p>
        <p>This is achievable with tools you likely already pay for, or low-cost additions. No custom software required.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="next-step-box">
        <h4>Recommended starting point</h4>
        <p>Set up an automated 2-step follow-up sequence on your quoting tool (or a simple email automation like Mailchimp or Zoho Campaigns). Connect a scheduling link to your calendar. Both can be live within a week and require no ongoing maintenance.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="doc-section">
        <p class="doc-section-title">Why this one first</p>
        <p>It addresses the highest-friction point in your current workflow, requires no disruption to how your team works today, and has a direct and measurable impact on revenue. It is also the foundation for more sophisticated automations — customer reminders, job completion follow-ups, review requests — that we would cover in a full roadmap.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="doc-disclaimer">
      This snapshot covers your single strongest AI opportunity based on the discovery call. A full bespoke roadmap covers every opportunity identified, prioritised with implementation detail. Names and figures in this example are fictional.
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="below-cta">
    <p><strong>Your snapshot is free.</strong> If you want the full picture — every opportunity, prioritised and written up — the bespoke roadmap is £350.</p>
    <a href="/call/" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1rem; padding:0.95rem 2rem;">Start your free call →</a>
  </div>

</main>

<footer>
  © <span id="year"></span> AI Growth Catalyst. All rights reserved.
</footer>

<script>
  document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
</script>
</body>
</html>
